<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Periodic Table Position Quiz | 30 Questions | Electronic Configuration</title>

    <meta name="description" content="30-question interactive quiz on finding element position in the periodic table using electronic configuration. Test your knowledge of period, group, and block determination.">
    <meta name="keywords" content="periodic table quiz, electronic configuration quiz, find element position quiz, s block p block d block f block, group period block quiz, chemistry MCQ, आवर्त सारणी क्विज, इलेक्ट्रॉनिक विन्यास प्रश्नोत्तरी">
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #080b12;
            --bg-card: rgba(18, 24, 38, 0.9);
            --bg-card-hover: rgba(26, 35, 56, 0.95);
            --bg-input: #0d1322;
            --neon-cyan: #00f3ff;
            --neon-pink: #ff007f;
            --neon-purple: #a855f7;
            --neon-green: #00ff66;
            --neon-amber: #f59e0b;
            --neon-red: #ff3355;
            --glow-cyan: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.45), 0 0 35px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);
            --glow-pink: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.45), 0 0 35px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.2);
            --glow-green: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.5), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.25);
            --glow-red: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 51, 85, 0.5), 0 0 30px rgba(255, 51, 85, 0.25);
            --glow-purple: 0 0 15px rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.4);
            --text-main: #f0f6fc;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --text-dim: #64748b;
            --border-subtle: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);
            --border-pink: rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.3);
            --border-green: rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.4);
            --radius-lg: 16px;
            --radius-md: 10px;
            --radius-sm: 6px;
            --transition-fast: 0.2s ease;
            --transition-smooth: 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.07) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 60%, rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.07) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 90%, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
            background-attachment: fixed;
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        header {
            padding: 20px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            background: rgba(8, 11, 18, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        .header-content {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .brand-icon {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-cyan), var(--neon-pink));
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 18px;
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }
        .brand-title {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffffff, var(--neon-cyan));
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        }
        .tag-badge {
            background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-cyan);
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            padding: 5px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 0.78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .quiz-wrapper {
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 60px;
        }

        /* Progress Bar */
        .progress-area {
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }
        .progress-info {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .progress-info .score-display {
            color: var(--neon-green);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .progress-bar-outer {
            height: 8px;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }
        .progress-bar-inner {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-cyan), var(--neon-purple));
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: width 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }

        /* Question Card */
        .question-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 32px 28px;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
            position: relative;
            animation: fadeSlideIn 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
        }
        @keyframes fadeSlideIn {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(18px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }
        .question-number {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-purple);
            color: var(--neon-purple);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            border-radius: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .question-text {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        /* Options */
        .options-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .option-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background: rgba(13, 19, 34, 0.7);
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition-fast);
            text-align: left;
            font-family: inherit;
            position: relative;
        }
        .option-btn:hover:not(.locked) {
            border-color: var(--neon-cyan);
            background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.06);
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);
            transform: translateX(3px);
        }
        .option-btn.locked {
            cursor: not-allowed;
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        .option-btn.correct-highlight {
            border-color: var(--neon-green) !important;
            box-shadow: var(--glow-green) !important;
            background: rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.08) !important;
            animation: pulseGreen 0.6s ease;
        }
        .option-btn.wrong-highlight {
            border-color: var(--neon-red) !important;
            box-shadow: var(--glow-red) !important;
            background: rgba(255, 51, 85, 0.08) !important;
            animation: shakeRed 0.5s ease;
        }
        @keyframes pulseGreen {
            0%,
            100% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.5);
            }
            50% {
                box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.8);
            }
        }
        @keyframes shakeRed {
            0%,
            100% {
                transform: translateX(0);
            }
            20% {
                transform: translateX(-6px);
            }
            40% {
                transform: translateX(6px);
            }
            60% {
                transform: translateX(-4px);
            }
            80% {
                transform: translateX(4px);
            }
        }
        .option-letter {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            transition: var(--transition-fast);
        }
        .option-btn.correct-highlight .option-letter {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--neon-green);
            color: var(--neon-green);
        }
        .option-btn.wrong-highlight .option-letter {
            background: rgba(255, 51, 85, 0.2);
            border-color: var(--neon-red);
            color: var(--neon-red);
        }
        .option-text {
            flex: 1;
        }

        /* Explanation Box */
        .explanation-box {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 18px 20px;
            background: rgba(8, 11, 18, 0.7);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--neon-cyan);
            border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;
            font-size: 0.93rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.7;
            display: none;
            animation: fadeSlideIn 0.4s ease;
        }
        .explanation-box.visible {
            display: block;
        }
        .explanation-box strong {
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
        }
        .explanation-label {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--neon-cyan);
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        /* Navigation Buttons */
        .nav-buttons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            margin-top: 24px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .btn {
            padding: 14px 24px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            transition: var(--transition-smooth);
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            font-family: inherit;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-cyan), #00a8ff);
            color: var(--bg-dark);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.65);
        }
        .btn-primary:disabled {
            opacity: 0.4;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            transform: none;
            box-shadow: none;
        }
        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }
        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-pink);
            color: #ffffff;
            background: rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.06);
        }
        .btn-skip {
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
            color: var(--text-dim);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .btn-skip:hover {
            border-color: var(--neon-amber);
            color: var(--neon-amber);
            background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.06);
        }
        .btn-restart {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            border: 2px solid var(--border-pink);
            color: var(--neon-pink);
            font-weight: 700;
        }
        .btn-restart:hover {
            background: rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.1);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-pink);
        }

        /* Results Page */
        .results-card {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 2px solid var(--neon-cyan);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            animation: fadeSlideIn 0.5s ease;
        }
        .results-icon {
            font-size: 4rem;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .results-score {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-cyan), var(--neon-green));
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            line-height: 1;
        }
        .results-outof {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .results-percent {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--neon-purple);
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .results-msg {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .mini-review {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 8px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            max-width: 500px;
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: auto;
        }
        .review-dot {
            width: 32px;
            height: 32px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: var(--transition-fast);
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }
        .review-dot.correct {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.15);
            border-color: var(--neon-green);
            color: var(--neon-green);
        }
        .review-dot.wrong {
            background: rgba(255, 51, 85, 0.15);
            border-color: var(--neon-red);
            color: var(--neon-red);
        }
        .review-dot.skipped {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }
        .review-dot:hover {
            transform: scale(1.2);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-cyan);
            z-index: 5;
        }

        /* Feedback toast */
        .feedback-toast {
            position: fixed;
            top: 20px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            z-index: 999;
            pointer-events: none;
            animation: toastPop 0.45s ease forwards;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .feedback-toast.correct-toast {
            background: rgba(0, 255, 102, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-green);
            color: var(--neon-green);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-green);
        }
        .feedback-toast.wrong-toast {
            background: rgba(255, 51, 85, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-red);
            color: var(--neon-red);
            box-shadow: var(--glow-red);
        }
        @keyframes toastPop {
            0% {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(-30px);
            }
            60% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(4px);
            }
            100% {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .question-card {
                padding: 20px 14px;
            }
            .question-text {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            .option-btn {
                padding: 14px 16px;
                font-size: 0.9rem;
            }
            .nav-buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            .btn {
                width: 100%;
                justify-content: center;
            }
            .results-score {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="container header-content">
            <a href="#" class="brand">
                <div class="brand-icon">Pt</div>
                <span class="brand-title">Periodic Positioning</span>
            </a>
            <span class="tag-badge">30-Question Quiz</span>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
        <div class="quiz-wrapper" id="quizWrapper">
            <!-- Progress Area -->
            <div class="progress-area" id="progressArea">
                <div class="progress-info">
                    <span id="progressLabel">Question 1 of 30</span>
                    <span class="score-display" id="scoreDisplay">Score: 0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="progress-bar-outer">
                    <div class="progress-bar-inner" id="progressBar" style="width: 0%;"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Dynamic Question Card renders here -->
            <div id="questionContainer"></div>

            <!-- Navigation Buttons -->
            <div class="nav-buttons" id="navButtons">
                <button class="btn btn-outline" id="prevBtn" disabled>
                    ◀ Previous
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-skip" id="skipBtn">
                    Skip ▸
                </button>
                <button class="btn btn-primary" id="nextBtn" disabled>
                    Next Question ▶
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <script>
        (function() {
            // ==================== 30 QUESTIONS DATABASE ====================
            const questions = [{
                id: 1,
                question: 'किसी तत्व की आवर्त संख्या (Period) कैसे ज्ञात की जाती है?<br><small style="color:#94a3b8;">How is the period number of an element determined?</small>',
                options: [
                    'A) इलेक्ट्रॉनिक विन्यास में उपस्थित अधिकतम मुख्य क्वांटम संख्या (n) से<br><small>By the highest principal quantum number (n)</small>',
                    'B) अंतिम इलेक्ट्रॉन के उपकोश से<br><small>By the subshell of the last electron</small>',
                    'C) संयोजी इलेक्ट्रॉनों की संख्या से<br><small>By the number of valence electrons</small>',
                    'D) परमाणु द्रव्यमान से<br><small>By the atomic mass</small>'
                ],
                correct: 0,
                explanation: '<strong>अधिकतम मुख्य क्वांटम संख्या (n) आवर्त संख्या निर्धारित करती है।</strong> इलेक्ट्रॉनिक विन्यास में जो सबसे बड़ा n (principal quantum number) मौजूद होता है, वही तत्व की आवर्त (period) होती है। उदाहरण: Na (Z=11) का विन्यास 1s² 2s² 2p⁶ <strong>3</strong>s¹ है → अधिकतम n = 3 → आवर्त 3।'
            }, {
                id: 2,
                question: 's-ब्लॉक तत्वों के लिए समूह (Group) संख्या का सूत्र क्या है?<br><small style="color:#94a3b8;">What is the formula for the group number of s-block elements?</small>',
                options: [
                    'A) समूह = 12 + s-इलेक्ट्रॉनों की संख्या<br><small>Group = 12 + number of s-electrons</small>',
                    'B) समूह = (n-1)d + ns इलेक्ट्रॉनों का योग<br><small>Group = sum of (n-1)d + ns electrons</small>',
                    'C) समूह = संयोजी s-इलेक्ट्रॉनों की संख्या<br><small>Group = number of valence s-electrons</small>',
                    'D) समूह = हमेशा 3<br><small>Group = always 3</small>'
                ],
                correct: 2,
                explanation: '<strong>s-ब्लॉक में समूह = संयोजी s-इलेक्ट्रॉनों की संख्या।</strong> s-ब्लॉक तत्वों के बाहरी कोश में केवल s-इलेक्ट्रॉन होते हैं। जितने s-इलेक्ट्रॉन, उतना समूह। जैसे Na (3s¹) → समूह 1, Mg (3s²) → समूह 2। <em>अपवाद:</em> हीलियम (1s²) s-ब्लॉक होते हुए भी समूह 18 में है।'
            }, {
                id: 3,
                question: 'सोडियम (Na, Z=11) का इलेक्ट्रॉनिक विन्यास 1s² 2s² 2p⁶ 3s¹ है। यह किस समूह में आता है?<br><small style="color:#94a3b8;">Sodium (Na, Z=11) has configuration 1s² 2s² 2p⁶ 3s¹. Which group?</small>',
                options: [
                    'A) समूह 2 / Group 2',
                    'B) समूह 1 / Group 1',
                    'C) समूह 11 / Group 11',
                    'D) समूह 3 / Group 3'
                ],
                correct: 1,
                explanation: '<strong>Na का समूह 1 है।</strong> Na s-ब्लॉक का तत्व है (अंतिम e⁻ 3s¹ में)। s-ब्लॉक में समूह = संयोजी s-इलेक्ट्रॉन = <strong>1</strong>। अधिकतम n = 3 → आवर्त 3। यह क्षार धातु (alkali metal) है।'
            }, {
                id: 4,
                question: 'p-ब्लॉक तत्वों के लिए समूह संख्या ज्ञात करने का सही सूत्र क्या है?<br><small style="color:#94a3b8;">What is the correct formula for the group number of p-block elements?</small>',
                options: [
                    'A) समूह = 10 + p-इलेक्ट्रॉन / Group = 10 + p-electrons',
                    'B) समूह = 12 + p-इलेक्ट्रॉन / Group = 12 + p-electrons',
                    'C) समूह = ns + np इलेक्ट्रॉन / Group = ns + np electrons',
                    'D) समूह = 18 − p-इलेक्ट्रॉन / Group = 18 − p-electrons'
                ],
                correct: 1,
